					<font fontName="SansSerif" size="10"/>
					<paragraph lineSpacing="1_1_2"/>
				</textElement>
				<textFieldExpression><![CDATA["We accept VISA, Mastercard, Discover and electronic check. For phone payments, please call us at  (505) 662-8333 or pay online at <u><font color='blue'><a href='https://www.losalamosnm.us/Services/Make-a-Payment' target='_blank'>www.losalamosnm.us/Services/Make-a-Payment</a></font></u> and select Utility Online Payments.<br />"+

"If you have any questions, or would like to make payment arrangements, please call us at (505) 662-8333. Thanks you for your immediate attention to this matter.<br />"+

"Los Alamos Department of Public Utilities<br />"+

"RIGHT OF APPEAL: If you dispute your utility bill, you have the right to present your objections by requesting an informal appeal hearing with the clerk prior to the service disconnection date set forth on this notice. You may contact the clerk at (505) 662-8333. This informal hearing may be conducted by telephone or at Los Alamos Municipal Building, 1000 Central Ave, Suite 130, Los Alamos, NM. The clerk will endeavor to issues a decision immediately following the hearing. Your service will not be disconnected while your informal appeal is pending."]]></textFieldExpression>
			</textField>
